Quick and advanced search results. NOINDEX,FOLLOW keeps them out of the index;
to stop them being crawled at all, disallow them in robots.txt instead. When set to "Use Magento
Default", the core Design > Search Engine Robots setting applies.

Serve /.well-known/ucp, the Universal Commerce Protocol business profile
(UCP 2026-08-25). It declares only the services and capabilities an installed module registers;
with none registered it is valid and declares nothing. Returns 404 when disabled.
